//==
// # Coordinate concept
//
// The marker concept for every point-like type: a position in some space, as
// opposed to the displacements of `vectors-geometric.plato`. The implementing
// types are declared in `points.plato`, `points-curvilinear.plato`, and
// `points-parametric.plato`; the derived bodies live in
// `numeric-structures-coordinate.library.plato`.

// A position in some coordinate space
// (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coordinate_system). Marker concept for all
// point-like types.
concept Coordinate
    inherits Value, Equatable, Interpolatable
{ }
